A story and a flow

The `App` calls the `API`, and the `API` calls the `Cache` and the `Database`.
Then write the story `read`: the `App` asks the `API`, the `API` misses in the
`Cache`, and the `API` reads the `Database`. Show both a flow and the sequence
of `read`.
---
App -> API
API -> Cache, Database
story read {
  App -> API: ask
  API -> Cache: miss
  API -> Database: read
}
show flow
show sequence of read
